{"id":"568df5609e652c40","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-lob-implies-4.md","title":"Löb Implies 4","display":"df-lob-implies-4 — Löb Implies 4","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-lob-implies-4","aliases":["89-df-lob-implies-4"],"display":"df-lob-implies-4 — Löb Implies 4","depends_on":["[[89-df-lob-axiom]]","[[89-df-4-axiom]]","[[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-lob-implies-4"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-lob-implies-4</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lob-implies-4 — Löb Implies 4"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"491579297d817026\" href=\"?note=491579297d817026\" title=\"89-df-lob-axiom\">89-df-lob-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"883bfda9f28cc5ea\" href=\"?note=883bfda9f28cc5ea\" title=\"89-df-4-axiom\">89-df-4-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bdef52f3ff411531\" href=\"?note=bdef52f3ff411531\" title=\"89-df-normal-modal-logic\">89-df-normal-modal-logic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}\\)</span> is the\nnormal-modal-logic predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bdef52f3ff411531\" href=\"?note=bdef52f3ff411531\" title=\"89-df-normal-modal-logic\">89-df-normal-modal-logic</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A}_{L},\\mathcal{A}_{4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal{A}_{L},\\mathcal{A}_{4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> are the Löb and 4 schemas.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LobImplies4}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{LobImplies4}(L)\\)</span> 是下述定义的一元模式蕴含性质谓词，参数为模态公式集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lob\\text{-}implies\\text{-}4}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LobImplies4}(L)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq L\n\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal{A}_{4}\\subseteq L\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lob\\text{-}implies\\text{-}4}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LobImplies4}(L)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq L\n\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal{A}_{4}\\subseteq L\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Löb公理蕴含公理4</li>\n<li>在GL中，公理4可从Löb公理推导</li>\n<li>GL不需要显式添加公理4（已被蕴含）</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-lob-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"491579297d817026","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-lob-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-4-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"883bfda9f28cc5ea","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-4-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-normal-modal-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bdef52f3ff411531","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-normal-modal-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bdef52f3ff411531","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$, and $\\mathrm{Normal}$ is the\nnormal-modal-logic predicate from [[89-df-normal-modal-logic]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{A}_{L},\\mathcal{A}_{4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LobImplies4}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lob\\text{-}implies\\text{-}4}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LobImplies4}(L)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\mathcal{A}_{L}\\subseteq L\n\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal{A}_{4}\\subseteq L\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1042,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-354","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-lob-implies-4]]"}],"outgoing":["491579297d817026","883bfda9f28cc5ea","bdef52f3ff411531"]}